# ==============================================================================
# NAME: Global Independent AGI & AI Ecosystem Rule-Set (AGI.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Categorized global independent AGI platforms, frontier LLMs,
#              GPU Inference Clouds, AI Search, Multi-Model Hubs, Agent/RAG
#              Frameworks, AI Coding IDEs, Generative Media Studios & Productivity.
#              Strictly excludes China Mainland AI (in China.list) and dedicated
#              rule-sets (Google, OpenAI, Anthropic, Meta, Microsoft, Amazon,
#              X/xAI/Cursor & HuggingFace).
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zezetata/Proxyer/master/AGI.list,"💥 AGI",extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

